From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: office <office@localhost>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 16:01:07 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 101/102] ui-egui: turn off upstream community chrome and the
 Share and Zotero tabs under the overlay

With OFFICE_OVERLAY_DIR set at build time: the title-bar Discord pill and its Options checkbox,
the Help-ribbon, Backstage and keytip Discord entries and the ui.discord command, the About
links to the upstream website, Discord and repository, the upstream copyright line (replaced by the
overlay's), the title-bar Share button and the Zotero ribbon tab are not shown. Every change is gated
on constants from office_overlay; without an overlay the behaviour is upstream's.
---
